{
  "id": "TIT.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "TIT",
  "reference": "Titus 3",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "TIT 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put them in mind to be in subjection to rulers, to authorities, to be obedient, to be ready unto every good work, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to speak evil of no man, not to be contentious, to be gentle, showing all meekness toward all men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we also once were foolish, disobedient, deceived, serving divers lusts and pleasures, living in malice and envy, hateful, hating one another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when the kindness of God our Saviour, and his love toward man, appeared, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not by works ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in righteousness, which we did ourselves, but according to his mercy he saved us, through the washing of regeneration and renewing of the Holy Spirit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which he poured out upon us richly, through Jesus Christ our Saviour; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that, being justified by his grace, we might be made heirs according to the hope of eternal life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faithful is the saying, and concerning these things I desire that thou affirm confidently, to the end that they who have believed God may be careful to maintain good works. These things are good and profitable unto men: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but shun foolish questionings, and genealogies, and strifes, and fightings about the law; for they are unprofitable and vain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A factious man after a first and second admonition refuse; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "knowing that such a one is perverted, and sinneth, being self-condemned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I shall send Artemas unto thee, or Tychicus, give diligence to come unto me to Nicopolis: for there I have determined to winter. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Set forward Zenas the lawyer and Apollos on their journey diligently, that nothing be wanting unto them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let our ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " also learn to maintain good works for necessary uses, that they be not unfruitful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All that are with me salute thee. Salute them that love us in faith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace be with you all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
